4
00:04:37,641 --> 00:04:43,141
白銀の獅子は 駆けて 駆けて 駆け続けている
The silver lion keeps running and running and running on...

5
00:04:43,141 --> 00:04:47,381
もう不安に振り返ることはないから
Because there is no turning back in anxiety anymore...

6
00:04:47,381 --> 00:04:55,101
百獣の王は 九十九を信じるから王なんだ
Because the king of beasts believes in ninety-nine...

7
00:04:55,101 --> 00:05:01,381
We have the pride, and it's our reason of pride, それこそ私の誇り
We have the pride, and it's our reason of pride—that is my pride.

8
00:05:38,286 --> 00:05:49,196
孤高は孤独の裏返しで ずっと一匹なんだろうって思っていた
Being aloof is the flip side of loneliness, I always thought I was all alone...

9
00:05:49,886 --> 00:05:55,306
前だけ睨んで ただ夢へ駆けて 足跡を見失って
Staring straight ahead, running toward my dreams, losing track of my footprints...

10
00:05:55,926 --> 00:05:58,476
変わらない曇天 交わさない動点
An unchanging overcast sky, unintersecting moving points...

11
00:05:58,476 --> 00:06:01,876
はぐれ山猫だって笑った
Laughing that I was a stray wildcat...

12
00:06:04,806 --> 00:06:15,976
音のなかった世界満ちて広げていく 人たちの声 野生の眼にかざされて
Filling a world that had no sound, expanding it, held up by people's voices and wild eyes...

13
00:06:16,446 --> 00:06:23,056
私は変わりつつある 蕾のLioness 立って なお爪を研ぐ
I am changing, a budding Lioness, standing tall and sharpening my claws still...

14
00:06:24,456 --> 00:06:28,226
友の前歩くため 真白い獅子は
To walk ahead of my friends, a pure white lion...

15
00:06:28,846 --> 00:06:37,416
群れて 群れて 群れを擁く それが私を支えてくれるから
Flocking, flocking, embracing the pack—because that supports me...

16
00:06:38,236 --> 00:06:45,816
純白の孤高を 追って寄り添ってくれるモノたち
Chasing this pure white isolation, those who stay close by my side...

17
00:06:46,866 --> 00:06:52,376
それこそ私の誇り
That is truly my pride.

18
00:07:16,746 --> 00:07:28,266
気高いふりして居場所の線を チョークで無差別に引いていた
Putting on a noble act, drawing lines of where I belong indiscriminately with chalk...

19
00:07:28,626 --> 00:07:34,466
目指したものだけ 輝くものだけ そして ただ迷うだけ
Only chasing what I aim for, only what shines, and just getting lost...

20
00:07:34,836 --> 00:07:40,426
見失う軌道 不安さの妄動 導いて欲しいって 気付いたある日
Losing track of my trajectory, agitated by anxiety, realizing one day that I wanted guidance...

21
00:07:40,876 --> 00:07:52,226
融けなかった凍土に やがて 広がりゆく 私達の熱 少しずつ 覚えていくから
In the permafrost that wouldn't melt, our warmth eventually spreads, learning it bit by bit...

22
00:07:53,306 --> 00:08:01,546
もし遠く ずっと遠く離れていても Львица 空に向け吠える
Even if we are far, far away, the lioness howls toward the sky...

23
00:08:02,176 --> 00:08:07,186
友に声届けるため
To deliver my voice to my friends...

24
00:08:07,766 --> 00:08:13,566
一輪の獅子は咲いて 咲いて 咲き吼えたいのさ
A single lion blooms, blooms, wanting to roar proudly...

25
00:08:13,966 --> 00:08:19,356
萌え出る瞬間を見守る人のために
For those who watch over the moment of budding...

26
00:08:19,766 --> 00:08:25,296
百花の王は 一緒に 一緒に 咲き吼えたいのさ
The king of a hundred flowers wants to roar together, together...

27
00:08:25,726 --> 00:08:33,136
We can be the king of beasts, together

28
00:08:33,906 --> 00:08:46,216
白銀の獅子は 駆けて 駆けて 駆け続けている もう不安に振り返ることはないから
The silver lion runs, runs, keeps running, because there's no looking back in anxiety ever again...

29
00:08:46,766 --> 00:08:52,326
百獣の王は 九十九を信じるから王なのさ
Because the king of beasts believes in ninety-nine to be a true king...

30
00:08:52,916 --> 00:09:04,876
今なら前だけを この夢だけを見て走っていられる 後ろに大切な私達の群れを纒うのだから
Now I can run looking only ahead, only at this dream, because I wear our precious pack behind me...

31
00:09:05,116 --> 00:09:11,306
We have the pride, and it's our reason of pride それこそ私の誇り
We have the pride, and it's our reason of pride! That is truly my pride.

