to perform songs I wanted them to sing or songs we wanted to do together, to liven things up!

39
00:10:25,215 --> 00:10:29,515
ちょっと最後までたっぷりいっぱいあるんで曲、よかったら見ていってください。
There are plenty of songs all the way to the end, so I hope you'll check them out!

40
00:10:29,855 --> 00:10:33,155
