凛として咲いたこの花は 悲しみさえも気付けないまま
This flower that bloomed so dignified, without even realizing its sorrow...

122
00:21:23,936 --> 00:21:26,886
安らぎを遠ざける
Keeps tranquility at a distance.

123
00:21:27,536 --> 00:21:31,136
そして今
And now...

124
00:21:31,736 --> 00:21:43,036
愛しさゆえ 傷にまみれた孤独 守るよ
Out of sheer affection, I will protect a lonely soul covered in wounds...

125
00:22:02,336 --> 00:22:08,636
それでいい 希望なんだ
That's fine, it's hope...

126
00:22:09,336 --> 00:22:15,036
せめて君の微笑み
At least your smile...

127
00:22:15,936 --> 00:22:22,236
守るよ それでいい 希望なんだ
I will protect you, that's fine, it's hope...

128
00:22:22,936 --> 00:22:29,136
せめて君の微笑み
At least your smile...

129
00:22:29,936 --> 00:22:36,036
守るよ
I will protect you...

130
00:23:00,436 --> 00:23:12,236
この声が聞こえるなら 渡り鳥よ 導いて
If this voice can be heard, O migratory bird, guide me...

131
