155
00:28:38,430 --> 00:28:47,860
傲慢な神は 目に映らない 光速度で 支配続けるならば
If an arrogant god continues to rule invisibly at the speed of light,

156
00:28:48,330 --> 00:28:59,160
僕は 僕だけは 奇跡的で 致命的な マイノリティでいい
I, and I alone, am fine being a miraculous and fatal minority.

157
00:29:00,430 --> 00:29:05,860
I can fly high!

158
00:29:07,430 --> 00:29:12,360
あの瞬間、あの場面が キミにとって特別なら 過去は離れて 行くものなんかじゃなくて
If that moment and scene were special to you, the past isn't something that simply drifts away,

159
00:29:12,660 --> 00:29:17,360
傷つく事の痛みより 大事なシーン その全ての
more than the pain of getting hurt, every important scene and all its...

160
