ヒカリが今 ゼロを生む
light now gives birth to zero.

161
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:28,360
There is no god. Wonderful new world.

162
00:29:41,430 --> 00:29:52,360
この命という夢幻 まだ錯覚とも知らず
This illusion called life, not yet knowing it's an illusion,

163
