Lamy-chan, come over here! You drive!

270
00:46:40,304 --> 00:46:44,964
一緒にやって、おしり振るだけ。せーの、ダルマさんが転んだ！
Do it with me, just shake your hips. Ready, set, Daruma-san ga koronda!

271
00:46:45,214 --> 00:46:45,954
近い！
So close!

272
00:46:47,594 --> 00:46:49,334
あれ、ししろん本日の主役じゃん？
Wait, Shishiron is today's main character, right?

273
00:46:49,414 --> 00:46:50,404
かけつけてきた！
She rushed over!

274
00:46:50,524 --> 00:46:52,754
最初はみんな！ししろんもう一回行くよ！
First everyone! Shishiron, let's go again!

275
00:46:53,094 --> 00:46:54,884
てるーちぇっと！
Teru-chette!

276
00:46:59,624 --> 00:47:04,374
ラミィじゃんけん…じゃんけんぽい！あいこでしょ！あいこでしょ！
Lamy rock-paper-scissors... rock-paper-scissors! Tie! Tie!

277
00:47:06,114 --> 00:47:07,334
負けた！
I lost!

278
00:47:08,784 --> 00:47:11,724
ダルマ…っと待って、ちょっと！
Daruma... wait, hold on!

279
00:47:14,864 --> 00:47:17,104
今日何？今日何、後ろ見えないじゃんこれ！
What is this today? What is this, we can't see behind us!

280
00:47:19,674 --> 00:47:24,704
ということで私、獅白ぼたんのちょっと遅れた3周年記念の…
So, my, Shishiro Botan's slightly delayed 3rd anniversary...

281
00:47:25,534 --> 00:47:32,394
え、待って、さっきさ、なんか「3年経って見たことない動き」って言ってたじゃん。
Eh, wait, earlier you said something like 'movements you've never seen in 3 years'.

282
00:47:32,534 --> 00:47:36,734
え、ねねちゃんの動き多分全部見たことあるよ！
Eh, I've probably seen all of Nene-chan's movements!

283
00:47:36,864 --> 00:47:37,594
負けた！
Lost!

284
00:47:37,734 --> 00:47:40,614
動きがいい、これこれ。ラミィちゃんさ、今の何？
Good movement, this one. Lamy-chan, what was that just now?

285
00:47:40,614 --> 00:47:44,414
高速道路。なんかさっきやってたやつ。
Highway. That thing we were doing earlier.

286
00:47:45,244 --> 00:47:50,624
あんま見ないかな、あんま見ないやつだよね。なんかストップウォッチだっけ？満腹系めっちゃ走る人みたいななってる。
You don't see that much. It's a rare one. Like a stopwatch? It looks like someone running really fast while full.

287
00:47:51,314 --> 00:47:53,514
ねねちょっとお前らのを観ておきたい。3周年？
Nene, I want to watch you guys' turns. 3 years?

288
00:47:53,514 --> 00:48:00,414
3年で初めて見る動き。3年で初めて見る動き。こういう感じ？
Movement you see for the first time in 3 years. Movement you see for the first time in 3 years. Like this?

289
00:48:00,914 --> 00:48:04,744
ああ、ちょっと待って。定規に、定規に揺れたほうがいいかもな。
Ah, wait a minute. It might be better to shake like a ruler.

290
00:48:04,744 --> 00:48:09,734
確かに。ふぁーふぁって進むの？これ、これ、これ最新ポーズ、最新モーションなんだよこれ。
True. You move like fua-fua? This, this is the latest pose, latest motion.

291
00:48:10,744 --> 00:48:13,614
え、だってししろんおしっこかかってるみたいじゃん。え、なんかあるかな？
Eh, because Shishiron looks like she got peed on. Eh, is there anything?

292
00:48:14,414 --> 00:48:15,744
3年間やったことない。
Never done in 3 years.

293
00:48:15,944 --> 00:48:22,714
なんで？なんでかわいそうじゃん主人公が。あ、そのまま定規に飛び跳ねたらカエルみたいで可愛いと思う、こいつ。ええ、そうなんだよ。
Why? Why is the main character pitiful? Ah, if you jump around like a ruler straight like that, you look like a cute frog. Eh, is that so.

294
00:48:22,714 --> 00:48:27,634
でも無いわ、これ無いわ。ダメダメダメダメ。もっと！もっと素敵にできるはずなんだよ！
But no, this is no good. No no no no no. More! You should be able to make it more wonderful!

295
00:48:29,234 --> 00:48:32,234
いや、見たことあるんだよなこれ。
No, I've seen this before.

296
00:48:32,534 --> 00:48:36,734
なんかねねちゃんのは全部見たことあるんだよな。必死感激しい。
Nene-chan's, I've seen all of them. The desperation is intense.

297
00:48:37,524 --> 00:48:41,424
じゃあ行こっか。4人で歌って踊るんでしょ？あ、そうそう！
Shall we go then? The four of us are gonna sing and dance, right? Ah, yes, yes!

298
00:48:41,634 --> 00:48:44,414
じゃあししろん、え、なんだろう今日、何歌う？
Then Shishiron, eh, I wonder what today, what are we singing?

299
00:48:46,244 --> 00:48:47,554
え、今から決めるの？
Eh, deciding right now?

300
00:48:48,634 --> 00:48:51,424
でも、決まってるんで、え？何？何？
But, it's decided, eh? What? What?

301
00:48:51,734 --> 00:48:57,644
なんか、私たちいつもさ、オルタラ歌う人みたいになってるじゃん。違う！
Like, we always look like people who sing alternative rock. No!

302
00:48:59,234 --> 00:49:07,634
だから、今日は、まあ今日は3周年記念っていうことは、みんなもようは3周年経ったわけだから、やっぱかっこいい歌を歌いたいなっていうのがあって。
So, today, well, today being the 3rd anniversary means everyone has also reached their 3rd anniversary, so there's this feeling that we want to sing a cool song.

303
00:49:07,744 --> 00:49:10,724
やっぱかっこいいバージョンのブルクラ？違うよ。
Like a cool version of Blue Clapper? No.

304
00:49:11,244 --> 00:49:14,544
ヘヴィメタルでやったでしょ？ヘヴィメタルでやったでしょ？
We did it in heavy metal, right? We did it in heavy metal, right?

305
00:49:16,244 --> 00:49:21,224
なので今日はちょっとかっこいいやつをみんなで歌いたいなと思うんで、よろしくお願いします！
So today we want to sing a cool song together, so please look forward to it!

306
00:49:21,444 --> 00:49:22,534
よろしくお願いします！
Please look forward to it!

307
00:49:22,724 --> 00:49:25,424
じゃあ位置についてみんな。
Then everyone, take your positions.

308
00:49:26,534 --> 00:49:30,524
その前にですね、ちょっと私の新しい新曲が出るので…
Before that, my new original song is coming out...

309
00:49:30,624 --> 00:49:34,414
え！オリジナル曲の！はい、そちらを歌わしてくだ…
Eh! An original song! Yes, please let us sing that...

310
00:49:34,734 --> 00:49:35,534
それは駄目でしょMC！
That's not allowed, MC!

311
00:49:37,524 --> 00:49:44,414
そう言うの！ししろんのアルバム出した聖書。あの、まあぶっちゃけた話言うと、あの、喋りに来てくれるようなと思って…
Saying stuff like that! Shishiron's released album Bible. Well, to be frank, I thought you'd come chat...

312
00:49:47,234 --> 00:49:52,424
気軽に呼んで！気軽に呼んで、ししろん！
Call us casually! Call us casually, Shishiron!

313
00:49:52,534 --> 00:49:55,424
じゃあ、ししろんのニュースは後ろで見ておくわ。見といてください。
Well, we'll watch Shishiron's news from the back. Please watch it.

314
00:49:55,724 --> 00:49:58,414
じゃ、この後みんな乱入してきて。
Then, after this, everyone crash in.

315
00:49:58,534 --> 00:50:00,414
結局うたうんだ！
You're gonna sing after all!

316
00:50:00,414 --> 00:50:01,211
あれ残るの？ここ。
Are you staying here?

317
00:50:01,534 --> 00:50:04,424
じゃ、ししろん温めといて。温めて、あたためといて。
Then, Shishiron, warm it up. Warm it up, keep it warm.

318
00:50:05,883 --> 00:50:09,503
お待たせ！お待たせしましたね、ブルークラッパーゲリでございますけれども
Wait! Thank you for waiting, this is a sudden Blue Clapper appearance, but...

319
00:50:09,703 --> 00:50:16,163
獅白さんの曲どんな曲なんだろうね、みんな、ピン！ピコピコピコピコ！どんな曲がよさっ、コメントは？
I wonder what kind of song Shishiro-san's will be. Everyone, pin! Pico-pico-pico-pico! What kind of song will it be, chat?

320
00:50:16,243 --> 00:50:21,243
楽しみだね、獅白ぼたんの曲！
We're looking forward to Shishiro Botan's song!

321
00:50:21,243 --> 00:50:25,243
へいへい！おいら！おいら！
Hey hey! Oira! Oira!

322
00:50:27,203 --> 00:50:32,683
じゃあこの後も頑張ってください！獅白ぼたんの曲楽しみだねえ！
Well then, please keep up the great work! I'm so excited for Shishiro Botan's song!

323
00:50:56,308 --> 00:51:01,708
[Title: Connect:Addict]

324
00:51:11,208 --> 00:51:16,208
答え探し 彷徨っている (何処にもない)
Wandering in search of answers (nowhere to be found)...

325
00:51:16,708 --> 00:51:21,708
教えてよ 持て余した
Teach me, my wasted...

326
00:51:21,708 --> 00:51:26,208
僕の正しい 使い道
correct way to use them.

327
00:51:26,408 --> 00:51:31,708
ふいに1秒 導かれて (鐘が響く)
Suddenly guided for a single second (a bell rings)...

328
00:51:31,708 --> 00:51:39,708
ヒビ割れた液晶の中 飛び込んだ仮想的現実
jumping into the cracked liquid crystal of virtual reality.

329
00:51:40,208 --> 00:51:46,708
目が眩むような 突然の閃光
A sudden flash of light that blinds the eyes,

330
00:51:47,208 --> 00:51:54,208
羽化する鼓動 生まれ変わるんだ
a mutating pulse—I am reborn.

331
00:51:55,008 --> 00:51:59,208
純白のbutterfly 自由にmidnight
Pure white butterfly, freely through the midnight,

332
00:51:59,208 --> 00:52:04,208
何もかもが全て揃う時代に (巡り合う)
in an era where everything comes together (we cross paths),

333
00:52:05,008 --> 00:52:09,708
キミは唯一 僕を求めた
You were the only one who sought me out.

334
00:52:10,008 --> 00:52:15,208
コネクトされる僕等の日々
Our connected days,

335
00:52:15,208 --> 00:52:20,708
昨日よりも上手く息ができる気がする
feeling like I can breathe better than yesterday,

336
00:52:20,708 --> 00:52:24,708
怖くない
it's not scary at all.

337
00:52:40,208 --> 00:52:45,708
“オウトウセヨ、そちらはどう?” (雨のちはれ)
"Come in, how is it over there?" (After the rain, clear skies)...

338
00:52:46,208 --> 00:52:54,708
感情がコンバートして文字となり流れていく
Emotions convert into words and flow away,

339
00:52:55,208 --> 00:53:01,708
キミの世界 届けるハロー (聞こえますか?)
delivering a hello to your world (Can you hear me?).

340
00:53:01,708 --> 00:53:09,708
遠い街 同じ唄で眠りつく奇跡的現実
Falling asleep to the same song in a distant town—a miraculous reality.

341
00:53:10,208 --> 00:53:17,008
モノクロだった 見慣れた画面が
The familiar monochrome screen

342
00:53:17,208 --> 00:53:23,208
いつの間にか 万華鏡みたいだ
somehow became like a kaleidoscope.

343
00:53:23,408 --> 00:53:28,208
夢うつつaddiction 魅惑なmission
Half-asleep addiction, enchanting mission,

344
00:53:28,208 --> 00:53:34,208
ガランドウな身体を 今、満たそう (煌めいて)
let's fill this hollow body right now (shining).

345
00:53:34,408 --> 00:53:42,708
誰も彼もが虜になる 妙薬の鱗粉 触れた瞬間
The moment they touch the magical medicine's scales that captivate everyone,

346
00:53:43,008 --> 00:53:53,208
退屈も刺激帯びてゆくことを キミに教えるよ
I'll teach you that even boredom starts taking on stimulation.

347
00:53:53,708 --> 00:54:10,208
誰かが放つノイズで羽が破れても キミの元へと
Even if my wings are torn by someone's emitted noise, I'll head to your side.

348
00:54:25,208 --> 00:54:32,708
純白のbutterfly 自由にmidnight 何もかもが全て揃う時代に (巡り合う)
Pure white butterfly, freely through the midnight, in an era where everything comes together (we cross paths).

349
00:54:33,208 --> 00:54:40,208
キミは唯一 僕を求めた コネクトされる僕等の日々
You were the only one who sought me out, our connected days.

350
00:54:40,208 --> 00:54:50,208
昨日よりもキミを近くに感じられる 抱きしめて
Feeling you closer than yesterday—hold me tight.

351
00:57:18,828 --> 00:57:21,748
その手は何を掴むためにある？
What is that hand meant to grasp?

352
00:57:22,008 --> 00:57:24,578
たぶん待つだけじゃ叶わない
Just waiting alone won't make it come true.

353
00:57:24,798 --> 00:57:28,168
その手は何を守る為にある？
What is that hand meant to protect?

354
00:57:28,468 --> 00:57:33,658
伝う熱は明日を輝かす種火に
The warmth passed along becomes a spark illuminating tomorrow...

355
00:57:34,258 --> 00:57:36,958
さあ新時代へ銃爪を引こう
Now let's pull the trigger toward a new era.

356
00:57:37,288 --> 00:57:40,658
伝説の未来へとカウントダウン
Counting down to a legendary future.

357
00:57:40,928 --> 00:57:43,398
羽撃きは一人じゃない
You aren't the only one spreading your wings.

358
00:57:43,398 --> 00:57:46,598
過去を 超えた先に 創るべき歴史が
Beyond the past, the history we must create...

359
00:57:47,638 --> 00:57:51,598
創るべき歴史が 咲き燃えてる
The history we must create is burning bright.

360
00:57:52,788 --> 00:57:58,808
絆 心一つに束ね 響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
Bind our hearts and bonds as one, and let the sound of hope ring out.

361
00:57:59,328 --> 00:58:01,658
「信ず事を諦めない」と
“Never give up on believing,”

362
00:58:02,088 --> 00:58:05,358
唄え可能性に ゼロはない
Sing out, because possibilities are never zero.

363
00:58:05,468 --> 00:58:09,368
飛べよ この奇跡に 光あれ
Fly high, and let there be light upon this miracle.

364
00:58:17,838 --> 00:58:20,758
切り裂けまだ見ぬ日に行く為に
Slash through to reach the unseen days.

365
00:58:21,058 --> 00:58:23,958
不可能なんて何ひとつない
There is no such thing as impossible.

366
00:58:24,208 --> 00:58:26,998
こんなに心強い事はない
Nothing could ever give us more strength.

367
00:58:27,438 --> 00:58:32,738
絶対 絶対 絶対 信じ合い ぶっちぎる
Trusting each other absolutely, we'll blast right through!

368
00:58:33,218 --> 00:58:39,398
例え闇に吸い込まれそうになって 涙さえも血に濡れて苦しくっても
Even if we're sucked into the darkness, and our tears are stained with blood...

369
00:58:39,718 --> 00:58:42,108
帰る場所が待っている
A place to return to is waiting for us.

370
00:58:42,398 --> 00:58:49,628
集え 守れ 契れ 勇気の結晶が 奇跡なんだ
Gather, protect, pledge—the crystal of courage is a true miracle.

371
00:58:51,978 --> 00:58:58,198
願い 祈り すべてを背負い 本気を越えた本気の唄
Carrying all our wishes and prayers, this is our ultimate song beyond all seriousness.

372
00:58:58,538 --> 00:59:02,578
痛みなんて何も怖くない 滾れ 沸騰せよ
We aren't afraid of any pain, boil over!

373
00:59:02,838 --> 00:59:06,908
このカラダ 翳せ さあ闇夜に稲妻を
Raise this body, and summon lightning into the dark night.

374
00:59:24,668 --> 00:59:28,728
出会い笑い合いそして泣きじゃくり
Meeting, sharing laughs, and crying together...

375
00:59:28,918 --> 00:59:32,218
命の炎も一緒に燃やして
We burn the flames of our lives side by side.

376
00:59:32,438 --> 00:59:37,728
五感の全部が叫ぶ 愛と呼べる程の 眩しく煌めいた
All our senses scream out, dazzlingly bright like what we call love.

377
00:59:38,148 --> 00:59:42,768
友の証
Proof of our friendship.

378
00:59:46,238 --> 00:59:51,778
絆 心 一つに束ね 響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
Bind our hearts and bonds as one, and let the sound of hope ring out.

379
00:59:52,068 --> 00:59:54,928
「信ず事を諦めない」と
“Never give up on believing,”

380
00:59:55,308 --> 00:59:57,828
唄え 可能性に ゼロはない
Sing out, because possibilities are never zero.

381
00:59:58,138 --> 01:00:02,078
飛べよ この奇跡に 光あれ
Fly high, and let there be light upon this miracle.

